---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com";
const description = "Privacy Policy for FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com explaining how we handle user data, cookies, and advertising partners.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-8 mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-mute" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">Legal Information</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mt-1 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-mute">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          At FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com, accessible from https://freemaintenancecaloriescalculator.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com and how we use it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">2. Client-Side Calculation Data</h2>
        <p>
          All biometric information you enter into our calculator—including age, weight, height, body fat percentage, and activity level—is processed entirely on your local browser using client-side JavaScript. We do not transmit, collect, or store your biometric data on our servers or databases.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">3. Log Files</h2>
        <p>
          FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable. The purpose of the information is for analyzing trends, administering the site, and tracking users' movement on the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">4. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          Like any other website, FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com uses "cookies". These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">5. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">
          Google is a third-party vendor on our website. Google uses cookies, including the DoubleClick cookie and personalized advertising identifiers, to serve ads to visitors based on their prior visits to FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com and other websites across the internet.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">
          Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve relevant advertisements to our users based on their navigation and interaction history.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads Settings at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline">https://adssettings.google.com/</a> or by visiting the Network Advertising Initiative (NAI) opt-out page at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline">https://www.aboutads.info/choices/</a>. For more information regarding how Google processes advertising data, please review the Google Privacy & Terms at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">6. Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics to analyze website traffic, measure aggregate usage trends, and improve our calculator interface. Google Analytics uses cookies to gather anonymous information such as pageviews, session duration, general geographic region, and device type. This data does not contain personally identifiable information and is processed strictly in aggregated form. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the official <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink underline">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">7. GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>
          We want to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the following: the right to access, the right to rectification, the right to erasure, the right to restrict processing, the right to object to processing, and the right to data portability.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">8. CCPA Privacy Rights (Do Not Sell My Personal Information)</h2>
        <p>
          Under the CCPA, among other rights, California consumers have the right to request that a business that collects a consumer's personal data disclose the categories and specific pieces of personal data that a business has collected about consumers, and request that a business delete any personal data about the consumer that a business has collected.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">9. Children's Information</h2>
        <p>
          Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity. FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">10. Contact Us Regarding Your Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy or data practices, please do not hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@freemaintenancecaloriecalculator.com" class="text-ink underline font-medium">hello@freemaintenancecaloriecalculator.com</a> or via our <a href="/contact" class="text-ink underline font-medium">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
